          "line_type": "chapter_title",
          "text": "ምዕራፍ ፡ ፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": "፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፩ ፤ ⟪ራእዩ ፡ ለዮሐንስ ፡ ዘከመ ፡ ርእዮ ፡ ለኢየሱስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክርስቶስ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስን ፡ እንዳየው ፡ መጠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ን ፡ ያየው ፡ ራእይ ፡ ይህ ፡ ነው ፡ ወማእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከለ ፡ ሰብዑ ፡ መኃትው ፡ ይነብር ፡ ከመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወልደ ፡ እጓለ ፡ እመሕያው ፡ ብሎ ፡ ኋላ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲያመጣው ። አንድም ፡ ዮሐንስ ፡ ወን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጌላዊ ፡ ኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስን ፡ እንዳየው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዮሐንስ ፡ አፈ ፡ ወርቅ ፡ ያየው ፡ ራእይ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህ ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘወሀቦ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ ከመ ፡ ያርእዮሙ ፡ ለአግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብርቲሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዮሐንስ ፡ ለደቀ ፡ መዛሙርቱ ፡ ያስተም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራቸው ፡ ዘንድ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ የገለጸ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለት ፡ ራእይ ፡ ይህ ፡ ነው ፡ (ጥቅ) ፡ ኢኮንክ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሙኑ ፡ አንትሙ ፡ ግብርየ ፡ በእግዚእነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲል ። አንድም ፡ አግብርቲሁ ፡ ለኢየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሱስ ፡ ለወዳጆቹ ፡ ይነግራቸው ፡ ዘንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የነገረው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘሀለዎ ፡ ይኩን ፡ ፍጡነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈጥኖ ፡ ይደረግ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ያለውን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዘይከውን ፡ እምድኅረ ፡ ዝ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኋላ ፡ የሚደረገውን ፡ ወዘይመጽእም ፡ ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላል። አንድም፡ ዘሀለወ ፡ ይኩን ፡ ፍጡነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የጥጦስ፡ ወዘይመጽእ፡ የሐሣዌ፡ መሢሕ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ ዘሀለወ ፤ የሐሣዌ ፡ መሢሕ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወዘይከውን፡የምጽአት።አንድም፡ዘሀለወ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይኩን፡ ፍጡነ፡ የምጽአት፡ ምነው፡ ዛሬስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንኳ ፡ ገና ፡ እንጅ ፡ ያይደለ ፡ ዘሀለወ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይኩን፡ ፍጡነ ፡ አለ ፡ ቢሉ ፡ ፈጥኖ ፡ ይታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የዋልና፡ እንዳይቀር ፡ ያውቃልና ፡ እንደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀረበ፡ ሁኖ ፡ ይታየዋልና ። ወዘይመጽእ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወእምዝ ፡ ርኢኩ ፡ ሰማየ ፡ ሐዲሰ ፡ ወም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድረ ፡ ሐዳሰ ፡ ብሎ ፡ የሚያመጣው ። አ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንድም ፡ ዘይመጽእ ፡ የጥጦስ ፡ ዘሀለወ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይኩን፡ ፍጡነ ፡ የሐሳዌ፡ መሢሕ ፡ ዘይመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽእ ፡ የሐሳዌ ፡ መሢሕ ፡ ዘሀለወ ፡ የምጽ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አት ፡ ዘይመጽእ ፡ የምጽአት ፡ ዘሀለወ፡ ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኩን ፡ ወእምዝ ፡ ርኢኩ ፡ ሰማየ ፡ ሐዲሰ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወምድረ ፡ ሐዳሰ ፡ ብሎ ፡ የሚያመጣው።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወፈነወ ፡ ምስለ ፡ መልአኩ ፡ ኀበ ፡ ዮሐንስ ፡ ገብሩ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በመልአኩ ፡ ባልደረባነት ፡ በእደ ፡ መል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አኩ ፡ ይላል ፡ በመልአኩ ፡ ቃለ ፡ አጽ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነት ፡ ለባለሟሉ ፡ ለዮሐንስ ፡ የነገረው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ ፈነወ ፡ መልአከ ፡ ወደ ፡ ባለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሟሉ ፡ ወደ ፡ ዮሐንስ ፡ የሰደደውን ፡ መል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አኩን ፡ ሰዶ ፡ የነገረው ፡ ቍ ፡ ፳ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false,
          "stage1_text": "አኩን ፡ ሰዶ ፡ የነገረው ፡ ቍ ፡ ፲፱ ፥",
          "stage2_correction": {
